== Overview ==
The '''Boss Toilet''' is a '''[[Godly]] [[Units|unit]]''' that was added in the [[Episode 77 Part 1 Update|'''Episode 77 Part 1 Update''']], it can be obtained by summoning it from the [[Advanced Toilet Crate|'''Advanced Toilet Crate''']] with a 0.1% chance. It is one of the most expensive units to upgrade in-game.

== Appearance ==
Boss toilet when placed looks like the [[Boss Toilet|'''Boss Toilet''']] but with hair and a different face his second upgraded look likes [[Boss Toilet 2.0|'''Boss Toilet 2.0''']] but with different face and laser his third upgrade look like [[Boss Toilet 3.0|'''Boss Toilet 3.0''']] with different amour and different laser and his final upgrade looks like [[Helmet Boss Toilet 4.0|'''Helmet Boss Toilet 4.0''']] with some difference.

== Obtainment ==
You can obtain the Boss Toilet by summoning it from the [[Advanced Toilet Crate|'''Advanced Toilet Crate''']] with a 0.1% chance, or by '''[[Trading]]''' for it, or by buying it from the '''[[Marketplace]]'''. 

